 Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布GPT-Realtime系列三款实时语音模型，支持GPT-5级推理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 发布官方 CLI 工具 openai-cli，支持一行命令调用 API 与 Agent 工具</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布Claude“Dreaming”功能并与SpaceX达成算力合作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果内置摄像头版AirPods进入DVT阶段，将赋予Siri视觉感知能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7389163bec52f55473fd14e4a7a7ce1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果首款AI可穿戴设备——内置摄像头的AirPods已正式进入设计验证测试（DVT）阶段，标志着产品工业设计与核心功能基本定型。该耳机外观参考AirPods Pro 3，内置低分辨率摄像头，并非用于摄影，而是作为Siri的“视觉感知”窗口。通过实时捕捉环境信息，Siri可实现食材识别、路标导航及主动生活提醒等功能。为保障隐私，耳机设有微型LED指示灯，在数据上传时亮起提醒。该项目研发历时四年，得益于与谷歌Gemini的技术合作，升级版Siri预计最快于今年9月上线。苹果计划通过高普及率的AirPods切入AI硬件市场，该产品被视为苹果构建全方位AI生态的关键一环，标志着移动AI竞争正式进入“感官融合”的新阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">工信部等三部门联合发布《人工智能终端智能化分级》国家标准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3c3f0495317b63136b13881a3b58130f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月8日，工业和信息化部、国家市场监督管理总局与商务部联合发布《人工智能终端智能化分级》（GB/Z177—2026）国家标准，正式确立国内AI终端智能化评价体系。该标准采用“2+N”架构，其中“2”包含《参考框架》与《总体要求》，将智能终端能力划分为L1响应级、L2工具级、L3辅助级及L4协同级四个阶梯。“N”则针对手机、微型计算机、电视、智能眼镜、汽车座舱、音箱与耳机七大品类制定专项规范。该标准由小米、华为、荣耀、OPPO、vivo、联想、科大讯飞等头部厂商联合起草。此举旨在扭转当前AI终端市场智能化概念泛化与评测标准碎片化的现状，推动产业从单纯的硬件参数竞争转向算法与场景协同，为产品研发、行业规范及消费者决策提供权威基准。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布GPT-Realtime系列三款实时语音模型，支持GPT-5级推理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式推出GPT-Realtime-2、GPT-Realtime-Translate及GPT-Realtime-Whisper三款实时语音模型，并集成至Realtime API。核心模型GPT-Realtime-2具备GPT-5级推理能力，支持复杂逻辑推理、外部工具调用及自然打断，音频输入与输出费用分别为每百万Token 32美元与64美元。GPT-Realtime-Translate支持70种输入与13种输出语言的即时转换，定价为每分钟0.034美元；GPT-Realtime-Whisper专注于低延迟流式转录，定价为每分钟0.017美元。此次发布旨在解决语音交互中延迟高、多语言支持难等痛点，标志着AI语音交互从简单响应向深度实时理解跨越，为开发者提供更具协作能力的实时语音解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 发布官方 CLI 工具 openai-cli，支持一行命令调用 API 与 Agent 工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7991529fc059178c1a8e155eeea22b73.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 正式发布官方命令行工具 openai-cli，该工具已在 GitHub 以 Apache 2.0 协议开源，支持通过 Homebrew 或 Go 安装。openai-cli 旨在填补官方工具链在命令行领域的空白，允许开发者无需编写 SDK 代码，即可在终端直接调用 OpenAI API。核心功能包括原生支持 Responses API，并可一键调用 Web 搜索、代码解释器、文件检索及图像生成等全套内置 Agent 工具。该工具采用资源化命令结构，支持 JSON、YAML、JSONL 等多种结构化输出格式，并兼容 Unix 管道操作，便于与 jq 等工具配合使用。此外，openai-cli 简化了多模态任务处理，支持语音转录、TTS 及图像编辑等功能，并集成了 API Key 管理与项目管理能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude“Dreaming”功能并与SpaceX达成算力合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic在开发者大会上推出名为“Dreaming”的AI记忆优化功能，通过模拟人类REM睡眠周期，让AI在任务间隙整理记忆库，解决长周期任务中的记忆过载问题。该功能可异步处理多达100个历史会话，提炼高价值知识，并配套Outcomes自动评分系统确保输出质量。实测显示，该技术使法律科技合作伙伴Harvey的任务成功率提升约6倍，在复杂模拟实验中表现显著。为支撑高强度运算，Anthropic与SpaceX达成战略合作，租赁Colossus1数据中心22万张GPU算力。此次升级直接提升了Claude Code使用限额，放宽了Pro/MAX版本访问限制，并优化了API调用速度。开发者可通过实时监控系统审查Dreaming生成的记忆优化结果，确保AI进化的安全性与可控性。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
